# Styling conventions

## Source of truth

Global styles flow from `src/app.css`, which imports utilities and component specific styles from `src/lib/styles/*.css`

- **Design tokens** live in `:root` in `app.css` — colors, spacing, container widths, typography scale
- **Component CSS classes** for typography (`.text-*`) and surfaces (`.surface-*`) live in `src/lib/styles/`
- **Layout utilities** (`.container`, `.text-width`, `.page-title`, `.page-content`) live in `app.css` but should be moved to relevant CSS files in `src/lib/styles/` during refactoring.

## Use tokens, not hardcoded values

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
color: #506458;
padding: 16px;

/* ✅ GOOD */
color: var(--muted);
padding: var(--space-medium);
```

Key tokens: `--ink`, `--muted`, `--accent`, `--bg`, `--surface`, `--line`, `--border-radius`, `--text-width`, container width vars.

## Dark mode
Not supported currently. But will be added in future.

## Typography

Two parallel systems exist during the refactor — prefer components where ready:

| Need | Preferred | Legacy (until migrated) |
|------|-----------|-------------------------|
| Body text | `<Text variant="body">` | `.lead`, default `<p>` |
| Page title | `<Heading>` (when ready) | `.page-title` on `<h1>` |
| Section heading | `<Heading>` (when ready) | `.page-header` on `<h2>` |
| Sub-section | — | `.page-sub-section` on `<h3>` |
| Constrained width | `PageContent` or `.text-width` | `.text-width` |

Typography component classes: `.text-body`, `.text-lead`, `.text-caption` with `.text-weight-*` — defined in `typography.css`.

Create additional typography classes if needed, but ask first.



## Component-scoped styles

Use `<style>` in `.svelte` files only for layout or structure unique to that component (grid, flex, responsive breakpoints). Pull colors, fonts, and spacing from CSS variables.

```svelte
<style>
	article {
		border-radius: var(--border-radius);
		background: var(--content-background);
		color: var(--muted);
	}
</style>
```

## Fonts

- Body: Roboto (`body` in `app.css`)
- Headings: Roboto Condensed (`h1–h6` in `app.css`, `--font-body` for Text component)
- Self-hosted in `static/fonts/` — do not add Google Fonts CDN links

## Containers & page layout

```html
<div class="container-wide">   <!-- full-page shell -->
  <div class="container">      <!-- centered content column -->
    <h1 class="page-title">…</h1>
    <p class="text-width">…</p>
  </div>
</div>
```

Variants: Will be phased out during refactoring, but currently support exists for `.container-narrow`, `.container-wide`, `PageContent` with `narrow` / `wide` props.

## Do not

- Add new global CSS files without importing them from `app.css`
- Introduce CSS frameworks (Tailwind, Bootstrap, etc.)
- Duplicate token values inline in component styles
- Remove debug/outline styles from WIP components unless asked (e.g. `MediaArticleSection` dev outlines)
